  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>External services</h2>
    <p>Links to third-party sites, including SEC EDGAR, are governed by those services’ own policies. Scrooner does not control their practices.</p>
  </section>
  <section>
    <h2>Beta changes</h2>
    <p>This notice may be updated as accounts, analytics, or additional product services are introduced. Material collection should be described here before it becomes part of normal product use.</p>
    <p class="public-meta">Last updated: 28 August 2026</p>
  </section>
</PublicPageLayout>
